      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. could you expand a bit more on the management side? specifically, i want to explain the potential downsides or 'hidden' complexities of active management vs passive. like, what are the actual risks for a client when they go with an actively managed mutual fund instead of just an index ETF?",
      "source": "evaluator"
